GNU Lesser General Public License, version 2.1 or later (COPYING.LGPLv2.1)

Derived from FFmpeg n7.1 (libavcodec/atrac.c, atrac.h, atrac3plus.c,
atrac3plus.h, atrac3plusdsp.c, atrac3plus_data.h, atrac3plusdec.c):
  Copyright (c) 2010-2013 Maxim Poliakovski
  Copyright (c) 2006-2008 Benjamin Larsson
Changes for UMD Player, Copyright (c) 2026 xesf, are dated in each file.

The decoder is linked into the app. Its complete source, and the source and
build files of the whole app, are at https://github.com/xesf/umd-player, so
you can change the decoder and rebuild the app with it
(cmake -S . -B build/vita).
FFmpeg: https://ffmpeg.org

